{"id":"8adbccc4211045f3","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-fixed-point-semantics.md","title":"一致固定点中的三值真理原子","display":"prop-fixed-point-semantics — 一致固定点中的三值真理原子","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-fixed-point-semantics","aliases":["91-prop-fixed-point-semantics","91-prop-fp-semantics","91-prop-kripke-semantics"],"display":"prop-fixed-point-semantics — 一致固定点中的三值真理原子","depends_on":["[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-fixed-point-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-fixed-point-semantics</span><span>91-prop-fp-semantics</span><span>91-prop-kripke-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-fixed-point-semantics — 一致固定点中的三值真理原子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a6ae68f45ba9960\" href=\"?note=2a6ae68f45ba9960\" title=\"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction\">91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}_T\n=\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner:\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Code}_T\n=\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner:\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_T\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_T\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (固定点信息集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\\to\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\\to\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点评价)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf t\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf f\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf u\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\n\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf t\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf f\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf u\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\n\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定点条件使真理原子的解释与对整个句子的强 Kleene 求值相匹配。\n一致性排除同一原子既真又假；若两种信息都缺失，其值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这不意味着固定点对所有句子给出经典完备赋值，也不意味着 KF 唯一选择\n极小固定点。极小固定点是一个规范模型，而非裸 KF 所有模型的唯一\n真理外延；允许 glut 的代数固定点还需使用四值而非上述三值分类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Code}_T\n=\\{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner:\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\\to\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf t\n&\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf f\n&\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\\mathbf u\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\n\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false}],"bytes":2158,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f276735320c6ad44","2a6ae68f45ba9960","fcfe6f023ac58abf"]}